---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="About this personal blog — notes on building, technology, and attention."
>
  <article>
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This is a personal blog for short essays and working notes. I write about software,
        product craft, and the quieter habits that shape how we build things.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site is intentionally small: a list of posts, an about page, and an RSS feed. No
        comments, no newsletter popup, no dashboard. The goal is to make reading and writing
        feel as calm as possible.
      </p>
      <p>
        If something here is useful, feel free to share it. If you want to get in touch, open an
        issue on the repository or find me on GitHub.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
